":"Godspeed"}},{"id":"1006302","name":{"zh":"强突","en":"Force Breach"},"level":"0","description2":{"zh":"对60度弧内80米距离的敌人造成2倍武力差伤害，小概率引发混战。","en":"Deals 2x STR-diff damage to enemies in a 60-degree arc within 80m. Low chance to trigger Melee."},"shortName":{"zh":"强突","en":"Force Breach"}}],"battleCards":[{"id":"1000900","name":{"zh":"游龙破军斩","en":"Dragon Breaker Slash"},"level":"3","description2":{"zh":"刀系绝技，如游龙附体，获得反伤效果，短时间内全面提高杀伤力。","en":"An ultimate saber technique, as if possessed by an agile dragon. Gain Damage Reflect and briefly boost overall damage."},"ap":"5","mp":"800"},{"id":"1006005","name":{"zh":"切削","en":"Rend"},"level":"1","description2":{"zh":"砍对位置才是有效的攻击，削砍敌人薄弱部位，造成流血效果。","en":"Striking the right spot is what makes an attack truly effective, slash the enemy's weak points to inflict Bleed."},"ap":"2","mp":"300"}],"debateCards":[],"warSouls":[{"id":"S1007805","name":{"zh":"维系[极]","en":"Sustain [Supreme]"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"提高士气防御力70%","en":"Morale Defense increased by 70%"}}],"battleSouls":[{"id":"1013605","name":{"zh":"驰骋沙场","en":"Warpath"},"level":"2","description2":{"zh":"速度提高30%，被回合外攻击时，防御瞬间提高50%，回合内每移动1米，本回合的攻击和暴击率提高5%。","en":"Speed +30%. Defense instantly +50% when hit by an Out of Turn Attack. For each 1m moved in a turn, Attack and Crit +5% this turn."}}],"debateSouls":[],"soulPoints":{"war":7400,"battle":6700,"debate":5400},"equipment":[{"id":"WP1004902","name":{"zh":"斩马刀","en":"Horse-Cleaving Saber"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"比普通的刀更沉更锋利，适合力大之人。","en":"Heavier and sharper than an ordinary saber, suited for those of great strength."},"atkVal":"10","price":"7000","slot":{"zh":"武器","en":"Weapon"}},{"id":"WP1000505","name":{"zh":"北地将军铠","en":"Northern General Armor"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"在常见的北地甲基础上增添了披风和吞肩兽，多为统军者、统领者所穿戴。","en":"Common northern armor enhanced with an added cloak and beast-head pauldrons, typically worn by army commanders and leaders."},"defenceVal":"8","hp":"550","price":"8200","slot":{"zh":"护甲","en":"Armor"}},{"id":"WP1021205","name":{"zh":"统帅陷阵盔","en":"Commander's Shock Helm"},"level":"2","description":{"zh":"在盔沿添加了额外装饰的陷阵盔，是对常年冲锋陷阵又全身而退之人的奖赏。","en":"A vanguard helm with extra brim decorations, a reward for those who repeatedly charge into battle and emerge unscathed."},"defenceVal":"6","price":"5500","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}},{"id":"WP29001","name":{"zh":"战马","en":"Warhorse"},"level":"1","description":{"zh":"战场上必不可少的身影。","en":"An indispensable presence on the battlefield."},"price":"2000","slot":{"zh":"坐骑","en":"Mount"}}],"family":{},"clans":[{"id":"GI110415","name":{"zh":"丘力居氏","en":"The Qiuliju clan"},"years":["0","207"],"desc":{"zh":"出自东胡，乌桓为东胡别支。丘力居为辽西乌桓大人，统领五千余落。辽西乌桓大人丘力居，自称王。中平四年与张纯、张举起兵反汉，寇略青、徐、幽、冀四州，后归顺幽州牧刘虞。初平年间去世后，其从子蹋顿代立，总摄三郡乌桓。建安十二年，曹操北征乌桓，在白狼山之战斩杀蹋顿，乌桓自此衰落。","en":"Originating from the Donghu, the Wuhuan were an offshoot branch of the Donghu. Qiu Lijiu was a chieftain of the Liaoxi Wuhuan, commanding over 5,000 settlements. Chieftain Qiu Lijiu of the Liaoxi Wuhuan proclaimed himself King. In the 4th year of Zhongping, he took up arms alongside Zhang Chun and Zhang Ju against the Han, raiding Qing, Xu, You, and Ji Provinces, before eventually submitting to Liu Yu, Governor of You Province. Following his death in the Chuping era, his nephew Tadun succeeded him, overseeing the Wuhuan across three commanderies. In the 12th year of Jian'an, Cao Cao campaigned North against the Wuhuan and slew Tadun at the Battle of White Wolf Mountain, after which the Wuhuan fell into decline."},"talent":{"military":"7","commerce":"5","politics":"4"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":null,"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1069","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[80,82,59,32,65,73],"title":-1,"